### get contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### get a single contact by id
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab313d549d5a30ed8359206

### POST: create a new contact (temporary)
# @name createContact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Wilma", 
    "lastName": "Flintstone",
    "email": "freddy@email.com",
    "favoriteColor": "gray",
    "birthday": "1900-10-03"
}
### GET: Retrieve the created above contact automatically
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/{{createContact.response.body.id}}

### PUT update contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/{{createContact.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane", 
    "lastName": "Smith", 
    "email": "jane.smith@email.com",
    "favoriteColor": "purple", 
    "birthday": "1990-05-30"
}

### DELETE contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/6abc2042a3557a3f18dae655



